  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced shallots and cook until they are lightly browned.",
    "Add the grated ginger, star anise, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the samphire and cook until it is tender, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the beef broth, fish sauce, and lime juice.",
    "Pour the broth mixture over the samphire and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste, then serve hot.",
    "Garnish with additional shallots and samphire if desired."
